    "title": "Lindenwood Baseball Unveils 2026 Schedule with Key Matchups - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By BVM Sportsdesk, ,\n1 days ago Lindenwood baseball has unveiled its 2026 season schedule featuring 32 home games. The season kicks off with a four-game series at Arkansas Pine Bluff on February 13. Highlights include a weekend series against 2025 College World Series participant Murray State and a home opening series against St. Thomas. After a hectic start, the Lions will host multiple conference games before concluding the regular season with the OVC Baseball Championship from May 19-23 in Marion, Illinois. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
